{
  "id": "918",
  "title": "Buy A New Dad",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-07-07",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming doesn’t want to let his dad sleep…",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/918/6bbc37c2aff4cc8b3d14d3358b2eac78c0da827f.mp3?1589700265",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "去超市买新爸爸\n\n小明：妈妈，爸爸怎么还不起床？\n妈妈：爸爸太累了吧。\n小明：妈妈，我们去超市买一个新的爸爸吧，这个爸爸我们不要了。\n妈妈：为什么呢？\n小明：这个爸爸太懒了，每天都起床很晚，不能和我玩。",
    "traditional": "去超市買新爸爸\n\n小明：媽媽，爸爸怎麼還不起床？\n媽媽：爸爸太累了吧。\n小明：媽媽，我們去超市買一個新的爸爸吧，這個爸爸我們不要了。\n媽媽：為什麼呢？\n小明：這個爸爸太懶了，每天都起床很晚，不能和我玩。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Go to the Supermarket and Buy a New Dad"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈，爸爸怎么还不起床？",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，爸爸怎麼還不起床？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma bà ba zěn me hái bù qǐ chuáng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, how come dad still hasn’t gotten out of bed?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "妈妈：爸爸太累了吧。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：爸爸太累了吧。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma bà ba tài lèi le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Dad is too tired."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈，我们去超市买一个新的爸爸吧，这个爸爸我们不要了。",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，我們去超市買一個新的爸爸吧，這個爸爸我們不要了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma wǒ men qù chāo shì mǎi yí ge xīn de bà ba ba zhè ge bà ba wǒ men bú yào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, let’s go to the supermarket and buy a new dad, we don’t want this dad."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妈妈：为什么呢？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：為什麼呢？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma wèi shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Why is that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：这个爸爸太懒了，每天都起床很晚，不能和我玩。",
      "traditional": "小明：這個爸爸太懶了，每天都起床很晚，不能和我玩。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng zhè ge bà ba tài lǎn le měi tiān dōu qǐ chuáng hěn wǎn bù néng hé wǒ wán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: This dad is too lazy. He gets out of bed very late every day and can’t play with me."
    }
  ],
